   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Aktiviteten saknar beskrivning. Kontakta Sida f&#xf6;r mer information. Ring +46 8 698 50 00 eller skicka e-post till sida@sida.se.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sida has decided to assign an independent quality group who should monitor and follow up on the APAD/SIPU co-operation. The objectives of the assignment are both to evaluate the project from a holistic perspective i.e. its role in the overall public administration reform in Serbia and to look at the efficiency of the project implementation and organisation.</narrative>
